"""
	Set up the AI Assistant
	@systemtype: WCNOW
"""
Begin Navigate to admin portlets
Navigate "?f=layout&s=pat&module=MASTER&name=AdministratorPortlets"
Click the "Review and sign an AI License for your system" link
Verify exists "END USER AGREEMENT AND TERMS OF USE" text
Click the "AGREE" button
Wait for page
Verify exists "Choose Security Roles" popup
Verify exists "Which security roles should have access to the following" popup text
Verify exists "Submit" popup button
Click the "Submit" popup button
Verify exists "The AI agreement has been accepted, and the assistant has been enabled." text

